  throws the color away and keeps the alpha, then paints every icon with the
  wallpaper's accent. That is the reason this is a solid silhouette and not a
  copy of the foreground: the belly and the eye whites are *drawn* in the
  foreground icon, and as alpha they would punch holes through the bird.
-->
